#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:15
#: 019df0e3f938497d8176b5a7b440b381 024e7c311a4844b492ec56199d7556ca
#: 5ceaf7cfcc89466b89206b1bc9059ad8 62bd62f8b32b4c7d97dfe584fd9cb089
#: 6fa31c65c4b7481c90018d475e872a65 a994f981b6cb470a8ea9947a2e65938d
#: c5b80d97202e463383f94d0f17f3571d e26697d614344332a4a60759275b4802
msgid ""
"GPS is usually mandatory in plane,copter,and rover vehicles, except when "
"some other position determining :ref:`sensor or system is used <common-non-"
"gps-navigation-landing-page>`. Sub does not use GPS. Compass is also usually"
" required for Copter, Rover, Sub, and QuadPlane types of Plane (see "
":ref:`common-compassless` for compass alternatives), but not for "
"Conventional Planes, however it is recommended."
msgstr ""
"GPS在固定翼、直升机和地面车辆中通常是必需的，除非使用了其他位置确定 :ref:`传感器或系统 <common-non-gps-navigation-"
"landing-page>`。潜艇类不使用GPS。罗盘在Copter、Rover、Sub和QuadPlane类型的固定翼中通常也是必需的（参见 "
":ref:`common-compassless` 了解无罗盘替代方案），但对于传统固定翼不作要求，不过建议使用。"

