#: 768c5f2f7fa447cfa60e7338220688cc b6c39629aa2e4ed3b6b4ab5f1f918e80
msgid ""
"It is important that a GPS be connected to the first SERIALx port that has "
"its ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` parameter set to \"5\" (GPS) since it will stop "
"searching for GPS during boot-up if not found on the first port configured "
"for GPS protocol."
msgstr ""
"重要的是，GPS 必须连接到第一个将 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 参数设置为 \"5\"（GPS）的 SERIALx "
"端口，因为如果在第一个配置为 GPS 协议的端口上未找到 GPS，启动过程中就会停止搜索 GPS。"
